# 1.1's saved data loads (format 2 to 3): a real 1.1 flash (tests/fixtures/flash-1.1.bin.gz, made by 1.1's simulator:
# day 27, Sext, the Cloister, Echo 19, Anselm vowed, Bede come), then one as 1.1 kept it with every old field set (the
# old brother in the infirmary, the rivalry, the histories of mistakes, a chronicle of them). The world, the settings
# and the preset are kept; the infirmary, the mistakes and their chronicle entries are gone; every Ambience at 100 %
flash_load app/build/tests/flash-1.1.bin
reboot
wait 300
expect format 3
expect day 27
expect office 4
expect preset 3
expect par8 19
expect vowed1 1
expect here6 1
expect here2 1
expect sung0 86
expect amb 20
expect eff37 45
expect chron >0
expect chrongone 0
wait 60000
expect phase 1
expect singing >0
tap ARP
wait 300
shot v11-brothers.png
tap HOME
# a 1.1 project with every old field in it
storev2
reboot
wait 300
expect format 3
expect day 27
expect preset 3
expect here2 1
expect here 7
expect part1 47
expect solos1 0
expect cantor3 0
expect chron 3
expect chrongone 0
expect amb 20
tap ARP
wait 300
shot v11-chronicle.png
tap HOME
wait 200000
expect offmode 0
expect clash 0
expect gone 0
# the migrated project saves as 1.2's and loads again
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect format 3
expect day 27
expect part1 47
expect chron >2
